    "notes": "Safest race of the four: incumbent Droba backed by the whole liberal opposition (SaS, PS, Demokrati, Team Bratislava); won 2022 with 63.6 %. Government coalition (Smer, Hlas, SNS) unites behind low-profile Gajarský (4.3 % in only poll) - in 2022 Smer+SNS candidate got 13.4 %. Krajčovičová (Právo na pravdu + SaNK) is the populist/anti-establishment option; Staruch is an ex-SaS independent splitting the liberal vote marginally. KDH and Hnutie Slovensko do not formally nominate anyone (not on Droba's nomination). Bookmakers price Droba at 1.01 everywhere. No AKO/JOJ24 BSK poll found (JOJ24 published AKO regional polls for TT, TN, NR, PSK, KSK). No withdrawals known as of 2026-10-20 (national withdrawals so far: Laššáková PSK, Lučanský ŽSK, Belousovová ŽSK). Turnout 2022 was combined-election turnout (38.60 %); 2017 standalone regional election 31.34 %."
